title: Jack-in-the-Box
text: The lid is shut tight, but the corners are open. Get red and blue inside to spring the jack, then catch it as it springs out.
trick: the conduit box can't be entered straight on, so teleporter pairs carry red and blue in; struck square-on by both, the starburst springs out magenta through the open corners, and a mirror outside each corner catches one ray
motif: a jack-in-the-box: a small conduit box with open corners, the starburst jack inside, four magenta rays springing out of the corners
ink: 4
expect: shared>=2
